#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
CAD Folder to PDF - AutoCAD First Plot Setup For All

A CAD/DXF/DWG batch plotter with AutoCAD first-drawing setup support.
- Batch converts every DXF in a folder to PDF.
- Converts DWG directly to PDF using AutoCAD/TrueView COM when installed, with ODA fallback.
- Exports paper-space layouts inside each drawing.
- Optional Model Space export.
- Optional merge layouts per drawing.
- Optional master PDF for the whole folder.
- Selectable Custom Method (P189 Opera) for independent AutoCAD paper-space PlotToFile retries.

Important: DXF uses ezdxf. DWG uses either the CAD Plot Center first-layout method or the separate Custom Method (P189 Opera). The standard method retains ODA File Converter fallback when available.

Run:
    python cad_to_pdf_win11_settings_rounded_FUNCTIONAL.py

Install requirements:
    python -m pip install ezdxf matplotlib pypdf pywin32
"""

